%% title: AnaCredit Reporting Flow — exposure feed & return rendering
sequenceDiagram
    participant FX as fx-service<br/>(caller-side)
    participant OP as Operator / upstream feed<br/>(ROLE_SERVICE or ROLE_COMPLIANCE)
    participant KC as Keycloak<br/>(OIDC)
    participant RES as AnaCreditResource<br/>(infrastructure/rest)
    participant SVC as AnaCreditService<br/>(application)
    participant REPO as PostgresCreditExposureRepository<br/>(infrastructure/persistence)
    participant POL as AnaCreditEligibilityPolicy<br/>(domain)
    participant BLD as AnaCreditReturnBuilder<br/>(domain)

    note over FX,OP: Step 1 — caller obtains EUR-equivalent commitment from fx-service
    FX-->>OP: committedAmountEur (threshold currency)

    note over OP,RES: Step 2 — register / replace credit exposure
    OP->>RES: POST /api/v1/anacredit/exposures<br/>{ instrumentId, debtorId, debtorType,<br/>  instrumentType, committedAmount,<br/>  drawnAmount, committedAmountEur,<br/>  arrearsAmount, defaulted, originationDate }
    RES->>KC: validate Bearer token
    KC-->>RES: token claims (roles)
    RES->>SVC: registerExposure(command)
    SVC->>REPO: upsert(CreditExposure)
    REPO-->>SVC: ok
    SVC-->>RES: unit
    RES-->>OP: 201 Created

    note over OP,BLD: Step 3 — render AnaCredit return for reference date (monthly)
    OP->>RES: GET /api/v1/anacredit/returns/{referenceDate}
    RES->>KC: validate Bearer token
    KC-->>RES: token claims (ROLE_COMPLIANCE or ROLE_AUDITOR)
    RES->>SVC: buildReturn(referenceDate)
    SVC->>REPO: listAll()
    REPO-->>SVC: List<CreditExposure>

    SVC->>BLD: build(exposures, referenceDate)
    note over BLD: Aggregate total committedAmountEur per debtorId
    loop for each instrument
        BLD->>POL: assess(exposure, debtorTotalEur)
        alt debtorType == NATURAL_PERSON
            POL-->>BLD: HOUSEHOLD_OUT_OF_SCOPE
        else debtorTotalEur < €25 000
            POL-->>BLD: BELOW_THRESHOLD
        else committedAmountEur == 0 AND drawnAmount == 0
            POL-->>BLD: NO_EXPOSURE
        else
            POL-->>BLD: REPORTABLE
            note over BLD: Map to CreditRecord:<br/>outstandingNominalAmount = drawn<br/>offBalanceSheetAmount = max(committed−drawn, 0)
        end
    end
    BLD-->>SVC: AnaCreditReturn { creditRecords, exclusionNotes }
    SVC-->>RES: AnaCreditReturn
    RES-->>OP: 200 OK — AnaCreditReturnResponse<br/>(credit dataset rows + exclusion audit trail)

    note over OP: ČNB / ECB submission is OUT OF SCOPE in v1 — operator exports manually
